"Change the interface language and theme in <a class=\"link\" href="
"\"%(settings_url)s\">Settings</a>."
msgstr ""
"Ubah bahasa antarmuka dan tema di <a class=\"link\" href=\"%(settings_url)s"
"\">Pengaturan</a>."

msgid "Save profile"
msgstr "Simpan profil"

msgid ""
"Deleting your account also deletes your analysis history. This cannot be "
