"%(n)s analysis will be deleted permanently, together with its text and "
"result."
msgid_plural ""
"All %(n)s analyses will be deleted permanently, together with their texts "
"and results."
msgstr[0] "%(n)s analisis akan dihapus permanen beserta teks dan hasilnya."

