msgstr "Teks cerita dan tokoh yang dikenali"

msgid ""
"Select a highlighted name to see the sentences that mention that character. "
"Use the arrow keys to move between names."
msgstr ""
"Pilih nama yang disorot untuk melihat kalimat yang menyebut tokoh itu. "
"Gunakan tombol panah untuk berpindah antarnama."

msgid "What do the labels mean?"
msgstr "Apa arti labelnya?"

msgid "a proper name, such as Made Bhaskara"
msgstr "nama diri, seperti Made Bhaskara"

msgid "an animal or object acting as a character, such as I Kancil"
msgstr "hewan atau benda yang dipersonifikasi, seperti I Kancil"

msgid "a god or holy figure, such as Bhatara Indra"
msgstr "dewa atau tokoh suci, seperti Bhatara Indra"

msgid "a name derived from a trait, such as I Belog"
msgstr "nama yang berasal dari sifat, seperti I Belog"

msgid "a reference without a proper name, such as memene"
msgstr "sebutan tanpa nama diri, seperti memene"

msgid "Solid underline: protagonist. Dashed underline: antagonist."
msgstr "Garis bawah utuh: protagonis. Garis bawah putus-putus: antagonis."

msgid ""
"Dotted underline: character found (roles were not classified for this task)."
msgstr ""
"Garis bawah titik-titik: tokoh yang dikenali (peran tidak diklasifikasi "
"untuk tugas ini)."

msgid "The number after the label is the character group."
msgstr "Angka setelah label adalah nomor kelompok tokoh."

msgid "Sentence context"
msgstr "Konteks kalimat"

msgid ""
"Select a highlighted name in the text or a character group to see the "
"sentences that mention it."
msgstr ""
"Pilih nama yang disorot di teks atau kelompok tokoh untuk melihat kalimat "
"yang menyebutnya."

#, python-format
msgid "Mentioned in %(n)s sentence"
msgid_plural "Mentioned in %(n)s sentences"
msgstr[0] "Disebut dalam %(n)s kalimat"

msgid "Also called"
msgstr "Disebut sebagai"

msgid "Character groups and their roles"
msgstr "Kelompok tokoh dan perannya"

msgid "Characters found"
msgstr "Tokoh yang ditemukan"

msgid "Entity label"
msgstr "Label entitas"

msgid "Mentions"
msgstr "Kemunculan"

msgid "Group"
msgstr "Kelompok"

msgid "Context words"
msgstr "Kata konteks"

#, python-format
msgid "%(n)s TF-IDF terms known"
msgstr "%(n)s term TF-IDF dikenal"

msgid "Model score"
msgstr "Skor model"

msgid ""
"Little context: this character appears in few sentences, so the label is "
"less reliable."
msgstr ""
"Konteks sedikit: tokoh ini muncul di sedikit kalimat, sehingga labelnya "
"kurang andal."

msgid "Show sentences"
msgstr "Lihat kalimat"

msgid ""
"Role labels are an aid to analysis, not a final judgement. The models have "
"limited accuracy: the average F1 of every model in the thesis is below 0.70."
msgstr ""
"Label peran adalah alat bantu analisis, bukan kesimpulan akhir. Akurasi "
"model terbatas: F1 rata-rata semua model di tesis di bawah 0,70."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Model used: %(variant)s %(name)s with %(features)s; macro F1 CV %(cv)s, "
"macro F1 test %(test)s."
msgstr ""
"Model yang dipakai: %(variant)s %(name)s dengan %(features)s; F1 makro CV "
"%(cv)s, F1 makro uji %(test)s."

msgid "Models used"
msgstr "Model yang dipakai"

msgid "Display mode"
msgstr "Mode tampilan"

msgid "Advanced (research mode)"
msgstr "Lanjutan (Mode Peneliti)"

