msgid "Satua analysis"
msgstr "Analisis satua"

msgid "Paste a satua text, choose what to analyse, then explore the results."
msgstr ""
"Tempel teks satua, pilih yang ingin dianalisis, lalu telusuri hasilnya."

msgid ""
"The analysis could not be completed because the server did not respond. Your "
"text has not been lost. Try again."
msgstr ""
"Analisis tidak dapat diselesaikan karena server tidak merespons. Teks Anda "
"tidak hilang. Coba lagi."

msgid "Try a sample satua:"
msgstr "Coba contoh satua:"

msgid "Analysing..."
msgstr "Menganalisis..."

msgid "Reset"
msgstr "Reset"

msgid "Up to 20,000 characters. Analysis usually takes a few seconds."
msgstr ""
"Paling banyak 20.000 karakter. Analisis biasanya selesai dalam beberapa "
"detik."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Analyses left today: %(remaining)s of %(limit)s. Failed analyses are not "
"counted."
msgstr ""
"Sisa kuota hari ini: %(remaining)s dari %(limit)s analisis. Analisis yang "
"gagal tidak dihitung."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"You have used today's quota of %(limit)s analyses. The quota resets at "
"midnight (WITA). Your history stays available."
msgstr ""
"Kuota hari ini (%(limit)s analisis) sudah habis. Kuota diatur ulang pukul "
"00.00 WITA. Riwayat Anda tetap bisa dibuka."

msgid "Analysing text..."
msgstr "Menganalisis teks..."

msgid "(i) Recognising the characters and their entity labels"
msgstr "(i) Mengenali tokoh dan label entitasnya"

msgid "(ii) Grouping the other names of each character"
msgstr "(ii) Mengelompokkan nama lain setiap tokoh"

msgid "(iii) Classifying each group as protagonist or antagonist"
msgstr ""
"(iii) Mengklasifikasi setiap kelompok sebagai protagonis atau antagonis"

msgid "Try again"
msgstr "Coba lagi"

msgid "No analysis yet. Paste a satua text to begin."
msgstr "Belum ada analisis. Tempel teks satua untuk memulai."

msgid ""
"Recognise characters, group their other names, and see whether they are "
"protagonists or antagonists in a text written in Balinese."
msgstr ""
"Kenali tokoh, satukan nama lain, dan lihat peran protagonis atau antagonis "
"dari teks berbahasa Bali."

msgid "Skip to main content"
msgstr "Lewati ke konten utama"

msgid "Workspace"
msgstr "Ruang kerja"

msgid "New analysis"
msgstr "Analisis baru"

msgid "About"
msgstr "Tentang"

msgid "About PrasiBali.ai"
msgstr "Tentang PrasiBali.ai"

msgid ""
"PrasiBali.ai is an Artificial Intelligence web application with "
"comprehensive Natural Language Processing, developed for understanding and "
"analysing Balinese folk tales (Satua Bali)."
msgstr "PrasiBali.ai merupakan aplikasi web berbasis Artificial Intelligence dengan Natural Language Processing komprehensif yang dikembangkan untuk pemahaman dan analisis cerita rakyat Bali (Satua Bali)."

msgid "Research"
msgstr "Riset"

msgid ""
"The research built three models for satua texts: character identification "
"with entity labels, alias clustering of the different names of a character, "
"and classification of each character group as protagonist or antagonist. The "
"thesis compared many models and features for each task; the research mode of "
"PrasiBali.ai lets you choose them and shows their reference scores from the "
"thesis."
msgstr ""
"Penelitian ini membangun tiga model untuk teks satua: identifikasi tokoh "
"beserta label entitasnya, alias clustering untuk nama-nama berbeda dari satu "
"tokoh, dan klasifikasi setiap kelompok tokoh sebagai protagonis atau "
"antagonis. Tesis membandingkan banyak model dan fitur untuk setiap tugas; "
"Mode Peneliti PrasiBali.ai memungkinkan Anda memilihnya dan menampilkan skor "
"referensinya dari tesis."

msgid ""
"Components that existed before this competition: the balinese-nlp package "
"(character identification and alias clustering), the BaliStoryAnalyzer "
"research software, and the pretrained role classifiers from the thesis "
"experiments. Built for the AI Web Innovation Challenge, Bali Digital "
"Festival 2026: this web application, including the research mode, analysis "
"history, quota and accounts."
msgstr ""
"Komponen yang sudah ada sebelum lomba ini: paket balinese-nlp (identifikasi "
"tokoh dan alias clustering), perangkat lunak riset BaliStoryAnalyzer, dan "
"classifier peran pretrained dari eksperimen tesis. Dibangun untuk AI Web "
"Innovation Challenge, Bali Digital Festival 2026: aplikasi web ini, termasuk "
"Mode Peneliti, riwayat analisis, kuota, dan akun."

msgid "Team"
msgstr "Tim"

msgid "Publications"
msgstr "Publikasi"

msgid "opens in a new tab"
msgstr "terbuka di tab baru"

msgid "Software"
msgstr "Perangkat lunak"

msgid "Breadcrumb"
msgstr "Jejak navigasi"

msgid "Home"
msgstr "Beranda"

msgid "Coming soon"
msgstr "Segera hadir"

msgid "Try it in the workspace"
msgstr "Coba di ruang kerja"

msgid ""
"This feature is on the PrasiBali.ai roadmap and is not available yet. The "
"three features below already work end to end."
msgstr ""
"Fitur ini ada dalam peta jalan PrasiBali.ai dan belum tersedia. Tiga fitur "
"di bawah ini sudah berfungsi dari awal sampai akhir."

msgid "Other features"
msgstr "Fitur lainnya"

msgid "Available now"
msgstr "Sudah tersedia"

msgid "F1 test"
msgstr "F1 uji"

msgid "What it does"
msgstr "Apa yang dilakukan"

msgid ""
"The names found by character identification are compared with each other. "
"Names that are similar enough are joined into one character group, such as I "
"Kancil and Kancil. The results show each group with the names it is called "
"by and how often it appears."
msgstr ""
"Nama-nama yang ditemukan oleh identifikasi tokoh dibandingkan satu sama "
"lain. Nama yang cukup mirip digabung menjadi satu kelompok tokoh, misalnya I "
"Kancil dan Kancil. Hasilnya menampilkan setiap kelompok beserta sebutannya "
"dan jumlah kemunculannya."

msgid "How it works"
msgstr "Cara kerja"

msgid ""
"The grouping is rule-based, so it needs no training data. A string "
"similarity method measures how alike two names are, and names whose "
"similarity reaches the threshold join the same group."
msgstr ""
"Pengelompokan ini berbasis aturan, sehingga tidak butuh data latih. Metode "
"kemiripan string mengukur seberapa mirip dua nama, dan nama yang "
"kemiripannya mencapai ambang masuk ke kelompok yang sama."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The default is %(method)s with a threshold of %(threshold)s, the best "
"setting for SatuaNER in the thesis (F1 %(f1)s, Tables 4.36 and 4.37). The "
"research mode offers all five methods and lets you change the threshold."
msgstr ""
"Bawaannya adalah %(method)s dengan ambang %(threshold)s, pengaturan terbaik "
"untuk SatuaNER di tesis (F1 %(f1)s, Tabel 4.36 dan 4.37). Mode Peneliti "
"menyediakan kelima metode dan memungkinkan Anda mengubah ambangnya."

msgid "Name similarity methods and their F1 scores in the thesis"
msgstr "Metode kemiripan nama dan skor F1-nya di tesis"

msgid "Method"
msgstr "Metode"

msgid "F1 with SatuaNER (Table 4.37)"
msgstr "F1 dengan SatuaNER (Tabel 4.37)"

msgid "Things to keep in mind"
msgstr "Yang perlu diperhatikan"

msgid ""
"Names with a suffix, such as Kakua and Kakuane, can end up in separate "
"groups, and general terms such as pekak can form a group of their own. Check "
"the groups before drawing conclusions."
msgstr ""
"Nama berakhiran, seperti Kakua dan Kakuane, bisa masuk ke kelompok berbeda, "
"dan sebutan umum seperti pekak bisa membentuk kelompok sendiri. Periksa "
"kelompoknya sebelum menarik kesimpulan."

msgid ""
"The model reads the satua word by word and marks the words that name a "
"character. Each name gets one of five entity labels:"
msgstr ""
"Model membaca satua kata demi kata dan menandai kata yang menjadi nama "
"tokoh. Setiap nama mendapat salah satu dari lima label entitas:"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The default model is %(model)s: a Conditional Random Field (CRF) whose "
"features were selected with binary particle swarm optimisation (BPSO). It "
"comes from the thesis research, was published at iiWAS 2023, and is "
"distributed in the balinese-nlp package."
msgstr ""
"Model bawaannya adalah %(model)s: Conditional Random Field (CRF) yang "
"fiturnya dipilih dengan binary particle swarm optimization (BPSO). Model ini "
"berasal dari penelitian tesis, dipublikasikan di iiWAS 2023, dan "
"didistribusikan dalam paket balinese-nlp."

msgid ""
"In the research mode you can choose one of the other models from the thesis "
"experiments. Reference scores from the thesis:"
msgstr ""
"Di Mode Peneliti Anda bisa memilih model lain dari eksperimen tesis. Skor "
"referensi dari tesis:"

msgid "Character identification models and their F1 scores in the thesis"
msgstr "Model identifikasi tokoh dan skor F1-nya di tesis"

msgid "Model"
msgstr "Model"

msgid "F1 cross-validation (Table 4.18)"
msgstr "F1 validasi silang (Tabel 4.18)"

msgid "F1 test data (Table 4.19)"
msgstr "F1 data uji (Tabel 4.19)"

msgid ""
"For each character group, the sentences that mention the character become "
"its context. A model trained in the thesis labels the group as protagonist "
"or antagonist from that context."
msgstr ""
"Untuk setiap kelompok tokoh, kalimat yang menyebut tokoh itu menjadi "
"konteksnya. Model yang dilatih dalam tesis memberi label protagonis atau "
"antagonis pada kelompok itu berdasarkan konteks tersebut."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The thesis compared six algorithms (%(algorithms)s) with word-vector "
"features (TF-IDF and FastText word embeddings) and lexicon features "
"(BaliSentiLex and part-of-speech tags)."
msgstr ""
"Tesis membandingkan enam algoritma (%(algorithms)s) dengan fitur word vector "
"(TF-IDF dan word embedding FastText) dan fitur leksikon (BaliSentiLex dan "
"POS tag)."

msgid "Default model"
msgstr "Model bawaan"

msgid "Best model according to the thesis"
msgstr "Model terbaik menurut tesis"

msgid ""
"The research mode lets you choose any of the available models from the "
"thesis experiments. Character groups with very little context get a warning, "
"because their labels are less reliable."
msgstr ""
"Mode Peneliti memungkinkan Anda memilih model mana pun yang tersedia dari "
"eksperimen tesis. Kelompok tokoh dengan konteks sangat sedikit diberi "
"peringatan, karena labelnya kurang andal."

msgid "Character analysis of Balinese satua"
msgstr "Analisis tokoh satua Bali"

msgid "Character analysis of Balinese satua in one workspace."
msgstr "Analisis tokoh satua Bali dalam satu ruang kerja."

msgid "Continue to the workspace"
msgstr "Lanjutkan ke ruang kerja"

msgid "Start analysing"
msgstr "Mulai analisis"

msgid "See how it works"
msgstr "Lihat cara kerja"

msgid ""
"Analysis needs an account with a verified email address. Texts are processed "
"on our own server."
msgstr ""
"Analisis membutuhkan akun dengan email terverifikasi. Teks diproses di "
"server kami sendiri."

msgid "Example of how results are shown"
msgstr "Contoh tampilan hasil"

msgid "Reading the characters of a satua takes time"
msgstr "Menelaah tokoh satua butuh waktu"

msgid ""
"Teachers, students and researchers still trace characters by hand, page by "
"page."
msgstr ""
"Guru, siswa, dan peneliti masih menelusuri tokoh secara manual, halaman demi "
"halaman."

msgid "Satua are rich in characters"
msgstr "Satua kaya akan tokoh"

msgid ""
"Satua Bali are folk tales passed down orally, full of people, animals and "
"gods that act as characters."
msgstr ""
"Satua Bali adalah cerita rakyat yang diwariskan secara lisan, penuh dengan "
"manusia, hewan, dan dewa yang berperan sebagai tokoh."

msgid "One character, many names"
msgstr "Satu tokoh, banyak nama"

msgid ""
"The same character can be called I Kancil in one sentence and Kancil in the "
"next, so tracking characters by hand is easy to get wrong."
msgstr ""
"Tokoh yang sama bisa disebut I Kancil di satu kalimat dan Kancil di kalimat "
"berikutnya, sehingga pelacakan tokoh secara manual mudah keliru."

msgid "Few tools for the Balinese language"
msgstr "Alat untuk bahasa Bali masih sedikit"

msgid ""
"Most text analysis tools are built for other languages, so Balinese texts "
"are still analysed manually."
msgstr ""
"Sebagian besar alat analisis teks dibuat untuk bahasa lain, sehingga teks "
"berbahasa Bali masih dianalisis secara manual."

msgid "PrasiBali.ai does the first reading with you"
msgstr "PrasiBali.ai membantu pembacaan awal"

msgid ""
"The first Natural Language Processing model for the Balinese language for "
"analysing and understanding Satua Bali narrative stories, developed in "
"research by a team from Universitas Udayana and Institut Teknologi Sepuluh "
"Nopember."
msgstr "Model Natural Language Processing berbahasa Bali pertama untuk analisis dan pemahaman teks cerita naratif Satua Bali, sebagai bagian dari riset dengan tim Universitas Udayana dan Institut Teknologi Sepuluh Nopember."

msgid "Read more"
msgstr "Selengkapnya"

msgid ""
"All AI models run on the PrasiBali.ai server. Your texts are not sent to "
"third-party AI services."
msgstr ""
"Semua model AI berjalan di server PrasiBali.ai. Teks Anda tidak dikirim ke "
"layanan AI pihak ketiga."

msgid "How it works in three steps"
msgstr "Cara kerja dalam tiga langkah"

msgid "Step"
msgstr "Langkah"

msgid "Paste a satua text"
msgstr "Tempel teks satua"

msgid ""
"Paste a Balinese text of up to 20,000 characters, or load one of the sample "
"satua with one click."
msgstr ""
"Tempel teks berbahasa Bali hingga 20.000 karakter, atau muat salah satu "
"contoh satua dengan satu klik."

msgid "Run the analysis"
msgstr "Jalankan analisis"

msgid ""
"Choose the full pipeline or a single task. Researchers can open the research "
"mode to choose the models from the thesis experiments."
msgstr ""
"Pilih pipeline lengkap atau satu tugas saja. Peneliti dapat membuka Mode "
"Peneliti untuk memilih model dari eksperimen tesis."

msgid "Explore the results"
msgstr "Telusuri hasilnya"

msgid ""
"Character names are highlighted in the text with their entity labels, "
"grouped with their other names, and labelled protagonist or antagonist. "
"Every analysis is saved in your history."
msgstr ""
"Nama tokoh disorot pada teks beserta label entitasnya, dikelompokkan bersama "
"nama lainnya, dan diberi label protagonis atau antagonis. Setiap analisis "
"tersimpan di riwayat Anda."

msgid "In development"
msgstr "Sedang dikembangkan"

msgid ""
"These features are on the PrasiBali.ai roadmap and are not available yet."
msgstr "Fitur-fitur ini ada dalam peta jalan PrasiBali.ai dan belum tersedia."

msgid "Ready for the next satua?"
msgstr "Siap untuk satua berikutnya?"

msgid ""
"Open the workspace to run a new analysis, or look back at your earlier ones."
msgstr ""
"Buka ruang kerja untuk menjalankan analisis baru, atau lihat kembali "
"analisis sebelumnya."

msgid "Ready to read a satua?"
msgstr "Siap menelaah satua?"

msgid ""
"Create an account, verify your email, and run your first analysis in a few "
"minutes."
msgstr ""
"Buat akun, verifikasi email Anda, dan jalankan analisis pertama dalam "
"beberapa menit."

msgid "Open the workspace"
msgstr "Buka ruang kerja"

msgid "Privacy policy"
msgstr "Kebijakan privasi"

#, python-format
msgid "Version %(version)s"
msgstr "Versi %(version)s"

msgid "Data we store"
msgstr "Data yang kami simpan"

msgid ""
"Your account: email address, full name, institution (optional), role, "
"preferred interface language, and the time you agreed to this policy."
msgstr ""
"Akun Anda: alamat email, nama lengkap, institusi (opsional), peran, bahasa "
"antarmuka pilihan, dan waktu Anda menyetujui kebijakan ini."

msgid ""
"Your analyses: the satua texts you submit, the analysis results, and the "
"model settings used, so that you can open them again in your history."
msgstr ""
"Analisis Anda: teks satua yang Anda kirim, hasil analisis, dan pengaturan "
"model yang dipakai, agar dapat dibuka lagi di riwayat."

msgid "How your texts are processed"
msgstr "Cara teks Anda diproses"

msgid "What we use the data for"
msgstr "Kegunaan data"

msgid ""
"To sign you in, verify your email address, reset your password, apply the "
"daily analysis quota, and show your analysis history. We do not sell or "
"share your data."
msgstr ""
"Untuk proses masuk, verifikasi email, reset kata sandi, kuota analisis "
"harian, dan menampilkan riwayat analisis Anda. Kami tidak menjual atau "
"membagikan data Anda."

msgid ""
"Verification and password reset emails are sent through an email delivery "
"service (Gmail SMTP)."
msgstr ""
"Email verifikasi dan reset kata sandi dikirim melalui layanan pengiriman "
"email (SMTP Gmail)."

msgid "Cookies and browser storage"
msgstr "Cookie dan penyimpanan browser"

msgid ""
"We use only the cookies needed to keep you signed in, protect forms, and "
"remember your language. Your theme choice is stored in your browser. There "
"are no tracking or advertising cookies."
msgstr ""
"Kami hanya memakai cookie yang diperlukan agar Anda tetap masuk, melindungi "
"formulir, dan mengingat bahasa Anda. Pilihan tema disimpan di browser Anda. "
"Tidak ada cookie pelacak atau iklan."

msgid "Your control over your data"
msgstr "Kendali Anda atas data"

msgid ""
"You can delete individual analyses or your whole history. You can delete "
"your account from the profile page; this permanently deletes your account "
"and all of your analyses."
msgstr ""
"Anda dapat menghapus analisis satu per satu atau seluruh riwayat. Akun dapat "
"dihapus dari halaman profil; tindakan ini menghapus akun beserta semua "
"analisis Anda secara permanen."

msgid "Language and theme"
msgstr "Bahasa dan tema"

msgid "Sign out"
msgstr "Keluar"

msgid "Footer"
msgstr "Kaki halaman"

msgid "PrasiBali.ai home"
msgstr "Beranda PrasiBali.ai"

msgid "Main"
msgstr "Utama"

msgid "Analysis"
msgstr "Analisis"

msgid "Available"
msgstr "Tersedia"

msgid "Account menu"
msgstr "Menu akun"

msgid "Sign up"
msgstr "Daftar"

msgid "Menu"
msgstr "Menu"

